---@field Destination aws.medialive.OutputLocationRef A HTTP destination for the tracks
---@field NielsenId3Behavior? aws.medialive.CmafNielsenId3Behavior|string If set to passthrough, Nielsen inaudible tones for media tracking will be detected in the input audio and an equivalent ID3 tag will be inserted in the output.
---@field Scte35Type? aws.medialive.Scte35Type|string SCTE-35 insertion type. Option "none" indicates that a SCTE-35 marker will not be inserted, nor will an IDR be inserted at the SCTE-35 cue point, nor will the segment be segmented. Option "scte35WithoutIdr" indicates that a SCTE-35 marker will be inserted to indicate the cue point, but MediaLive will not insert an IDR on that frame nor will it introduce a new segment boundary there if it wasn't al...
---@field SegmentLength? aws.medialive.__integerMin1 The nominal duration of segments. The units are specified in SegmentLengthUnits. The segments will end on the next keyframe after the specified duration, so the actual segment length might be longer, and it might be a fraction of the units.
