---@field EncryptionType? aws.medialive.HlsEncryptionType|string Encrypts the segments with the given encryption scheme. Exclude this parameter if no encryption is desired.
---@field HlsCdnSettings? aws.medialive.HlsCdnSettings Parameters that control interactions with the CDN.
